    "type": "game",
    "name": "Children of Mare",
    "steam_appid": 3073750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/b3046e78f521341e4dfc642481b02028.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children's of Mare,  seamlessly blends the colony management and roguelite genres into a unique experience. Players command nightmares under the orders of Mare, the goddess of nightmares, with the aim of invading and consuming the host, where players build, expand, and corrupt colonies in a dreamlike world. They explore diverse biomes, gather resources, complete missions, and face unique challenges in each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mother doesn\u2019t stop creating and needs a little more from us.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/34db61cf170d34337f72ba1034228b6d.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span><i>All for Mare: You've invaded a mind, infiltrating with Mare\u2019s nightmares.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your influence in the subconscious by constructing critical facilities that solidify control and corrupt the host. Start with Mare and develop essential structures, including Storage for efficient management, Cloning for creating minions, and Refineries to upgrade basic materials into advanced components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, execute Mare\u2019s orders, and consume the host in this relentless strategy. Face the darkness and seize mental domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/db9bc473aaa591a92317b7ddcceece63.poster.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/db9bc473aaa591a92317b7ddcceece63.webm?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/db9bc473aaa591a92317b7ddcceece63.mp4?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you design your network of power to maximize effectiveness and secure control? Are you ready to conquer every corner of the subconscious and impose Mare\u2019s will?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/18d208b2a7fb96b26d97135029167009.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span>Each mind is unique, presenting challenges you've never faced, and dangers that could bring you to your end. But all hope is not lost. You have the power to perform rituals that can bend the course of the game to your will. Discover buildings that have never been seen before, reshape your minions to make them faster, stronger or even allow them teleport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/e6d653163bb9f5e35aa4e77193b44175.poster.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/e6d653163bb9f5e35aa4e77193b44175.webm?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/e6d653163bb9f5e35aa4e77193b44175.mp4?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is only the beginning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/4263adf0c54849427edb00eebf28652e.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span>Hidden deep within the brain of your victim, hunt the ruins of The seven deadly sins and a host of other evil, which will lay waste to everything you've built to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer them, hold them, do whatever you can to not let them alter your colony and destroy it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you tame the ruins, use them to take advantage of them and end your victim to feed Mare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/5014d9679f83267a9c2953cfd22f7ab3.poster.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/5014d9679f83267a9c2953cfd22f7ab3.webm?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/5014d9679f83267a9c2953cfd22f7ab3.mp4?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So be careful!, be Fast! and don't let the ruins get over you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/393cfb8f97ef8a5736630e0091430934.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span>Have you already conquered the host's mind? Great, but it doesn't end there. Mare is always thirsty for fear, so she will reward you with new unlocks  to encourage you  to consume more minds where you can start from scratch, choose different rituals, and explore more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/b3046e78f521341e4dfc642481b02028.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children's of Mare,  seamlessly blends the colony management and roguelite genres into a unique experience. Players command nightmares under the orders of Mare, the goddess of nightmares, with the aim of invading and consuming the host, where players build, expand, and corrupt colonies in a dreamlike world. They explore diverse biomes, gather resources, complete missions, and face unique challenges in each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mother doesn\u2019t stop creating and needs a little more from us.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/34db61cf170d34337f72ba1034228b6d.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span><i>All for Mare: You've invaded a mind, infiltrating with Mare\u2019s nightmares.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and expand your influence in the subconscious by constructing critical facilities that solidify control and corrupt the host. Start with Mare and develop essential structures, including Storage for efficient management, Cloning for creating minions, and Refineries to upgrade basic materials into advanced components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, execute Mare\u2019s orders, and consume the host in this relentless strategy. Face the darkness and seize mental domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/db9bc473aaa591a92317b7ddcceece63.poster.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/db9bc473aaa591a92317b7ddcceece63.webm?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/db9bc473aaa591a92317b7ddcceece63.mp4?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will you design your network of power to maximize effectiveness and secure control? Are you ready to conquer every corner of the subconscious and impose Mare\u2019s will?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/18d208b2a7fb96b26d97135029167009.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span>Each mind is unique, presenting challenges you've never faced, and dangers that could bring you to your end. But all hope is not lost. You have the power to perform rituals that can bend the course of the game to your will. Discover buildings that have never been seen before, reshape your minions to make them faster, stronger or even allow them teleport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/e6d653163bb9f5e35aa4e77193b44175.poster.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/e6d653163bb9f5e35aa4e77193b44175.webm?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/e6d653163bb9f5e35aa4e77193b44175.mp4?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is only the beginning.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/4263adf0c54849427edb00eebf28652e.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span>Hidden deep within the brain of your victim, hunt the ruins of The seven deadly sins and a host of other evil, which will lay waste to everything you've built to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer them, hold them, do whatever you can to not let them alter your colony and destroy it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you tame the ruins, use them to take advantage of them and end your victim to feed Mare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/5014d9679f83267a9c2953cfd22f7ab3.poster.avif?t=1754899315\" width=602 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/5014d9679f83267a9c2953cfd22f7ab3.webm?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/5014d9679f83267a9c2953cfd22f7ab3.mp4?t=1754899315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So be careful!, be Fast! and don't let the ruins get over you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073750/extras/393cfb8f97ef8a5736630e0091430934.webp?t=1754899315\" width=603 height=56 /></span>Have you already conquered the host's mind? Great, but it doesn't end there. Mare is always thirsty for fear, so she will reward you with new unlocks  to encourage you  to consume more minds where you can start from scratch, choose different rituals, and explore more.</p>",
